WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:17.892
Nina glanced down the hallway.

2
00:00:17.893 --> 00:00:20.481
It was empty.

3
00:00:20.482 --> 00:00:24.628
She quickly pulled her jump rope out of her backpack.

4
00:00:24.629 --> 00:00:29.433
Then she began to skip down the hall.

5
00:00:29.435 --> 00:00:32.158
"Hey. Stop it right there.

6
00:00:32.159 --> 00:00:36.331
No jumping inside!" someone called.

7
00:00:36.332 --> 00:00:42.053
Nina froze. She turned around and saw the fifth-grade hall monitor.

8
00:00:42.054 --> 00:00:45.104
Where had he come from?

9
00:00:45.105 --> 00:00:49.922
"Sorry, I was just going to the gym," she said.

10
00:00:49.923 --> 00:00:55.024
"Jumping rope inside gets a note to the principal," he said.

11
00:00:55.025 --> 00:00:59.802
Nina sighed and watched him write out a note.

12
00:00:59.803 --> 00:01:04.601
"Ms. Folani will see this right away," he said.

13
00:01:04.602 --> 00:01:10.522
That made Nina grumpy.

14
00:01:10.523 --> 00:01:17.246
But when she walked into the gym for Kids Central, she smiled.

15
00:01:17.247 --> 00:01:21.574
Miss Shelly was holding a long, orange jump rope.

16
00:01:21.575 --> 00:01:23.997
Izzie was jumping rope and chanting,

17
00:01:23.998 --> 00:01:27.059
"I like coffee. I like tea.

18
00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:30.611
I'd like Nina to jump with me!"

19
00:01:30.612 --> 00:01:36.226
"I'm coming!" Nina cried, throwing down her backpack.

20
00:01:36.227 --> 00:01:40.971
She took out her jump rope and began to jump in time with Izzie.

21
00:01:40.972 --> 00:01:44.052
"I like coffee. I like tea.

22
00:01:44.053 --> 00:01:48.682
I'd like Jason to jump with me!" Izzie chanted.

23
00:01:48.683 --> 00:01:53.297
Jason picked up his rope to jump with the girls.

24
00:01:53.298 --> 00:01:55.821
But Miss Shelly blew her whistle.

25
00:01:55.822 --> 00:02:00.338
"Let's take this outside, kids," she called.

26
00:02:00.339 --> 00:02:10.597
"And remember, we will walk, not jump, in the hallway."

27
00:02:10.598 --> 00:02:16.608
"As you know, today is jump-rope day," Miss Shelly said.

28
00:02:16.609 --> 00:02:19.624
"We'll all take turns jumping.

29
00:02:19.625 --> 00:02:24.089
But first I need two turners to turn the rope."

30
00:02:24.090 --> 00:02:26.702
Nina elbowed Bobby.

31
00:02:26.703 --> 00:02:29.519
Izzie elbowed Jason.

32
00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:33.925
"We'll be turners," the boys said.

33
00:02:33.926 --> 00:02:39.561
"Great. And Nina and Izzie said they'd share some jump-rope rhymes with us.

34
00:02:39.562 --> 00:02:42.873
Right, girls?" their teacher asked.

35
00:02:42.874 --> 00:02:48.543
"Yep. You might know these already," Nina said to the boys.

36
00:02:48.544 --> 00:02:52.292
"Are you ready, Nina?" Miss Shelly asked.

37
00:02:52.293 --> 00:02:54.905
Nina jumped up and down.

38
00:02:54.906 --> 00:02:58.583
"I think so! I've been practicing."

39
00:02:58.584 --> 00:03:04.371
"We start with 'Nina, Nina, Turn Around.' Okay?" Izzie said.

40
00:03:04.372 --> 00:03:08.453
The boys and Miss Shelly nodded.

41
00:03:08.454 --> 00:03:12.523
"Nina, Nina, turn around.

42
00:03:12.524 --> 00:03:17.156
Nina, Nina, touch the ground.

43
00:03:17.157 --> 00:03:21.478
Nina, Nina, show your shoe.

44
00:03:21.479 --> 00:03:27.670
Nina, Nina, that will do," they chanted.

45
00:03:27.671 --> 00:03:30.898
"Perfect!" Izzie cried.

46
00:03:30.899 --> 00:03:36.680
"Izzie, it's your turn," Jason called, still turning the rope.

47
00:03:36.681 --> 00:03:39.406
"Okay. Here I come!

48
00:03:39.407 --> 00:03:44.777
Do 'Strawberry Shortcake,'" Izzie said as she jumped in.

49
00:03:44.778 --> 00:03:49.147
"Strawberry shortcake, cream on top.

50
00:03:49.148 --> 00:03:53.509
Tell me the name of your sweetheart.

51
00:03:53.510 --> 00:04:04.781
A, B, C, D, E, F, G, H, I, J—"

52
00:04:04.782 --> 00:04:11.881
"Ooh, you're in love with Jason!" Nina squealed.

53
00:04:11.882 --> 00:04:15.563
"I am not!" Izzie said, out of breath.

54
00:04:15.564 --> 00:04:19.306
But everyone saw her blush.

55
00:04:19.307 --> 00:04:21.335
"Okay, last turn.

56
00:04:21.336 --> 00:04:25.380
Let's do 'Coffee and Tea,'" she said quickly.

57
00:04:25.381 --> 00:04:28.940
"Turn the rope," Nina told the boys.

58
00:04:28.941 --> 00:04:37.098
She spotted Ms. Folani walking across the blacktop to the parking lot.

59
00:04:37.099 --> 00:04:41.157
"I like coffee. I like tea.

60
00:04:41.158 --> 00:04:48.240
I'd like Ms. Folani to jump with me!" the girls called.

61
00:04:48.241 --> 00:04:53.052
The principal looked surprised.

62
00:04:53.053 --> 00:04:57.922
But then she put down her bag and hopped in.

63
00:04:57.923 --> 00:05:05.791
"It's much more fun to jump outside, isn't it, Nina?" she said.
